                {t('Unverified', 'Chưa verify')}
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              {t('PowerShell guidance for env_key mode. Treat this as expected behavior until it is tested on Windows Codex App.', 'Guidance PowerShell cho chế độ env_key. Xem đây là expected behavior cho tới khi được test trên Windows Codex App.')}
            </p>
          </div>
          <TerminalSnippet code={windowsEnv} label="powershell · unverified env_key" compact />
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
